sequenceDiagram

actor User

participant Frontend as Next.js

participant Middleware as Auth Middleware

participant Router as FastAPI Router

participant Service as Business Service

participant Retriever as Retriever

participant Database as PostgreSQL

participant GPT as OpenAI GPT-5.5

User->>Frontend: Ask Financial Question

Frontend->>Middleware: HTTP Request

Middleware->>Router: Validate JWT

Router->>Service: Route Request

Service->>Retriever: Retrieve Context

Retriever->>Database: Vector Search

Database-->>Retriever: Relevant Documents

Retriever-->>Service: Context

Service->>GPT: Prompt + Context

GPT-->>Service: Grounded Response

Service-->>Router: JSON

Router-->>Frontend: HTTP 200

Frontend-->>User: Display Answer